PosAgent Shared Work Log
========================

Purpose
-------
This is the shared handoff log for all agents working in this workspace. Read it before making changes. Append a dated entry after completing work; do not rewrite prior entries. Keep entries factual and concise. Record changed paths, behavior, verification commands/results, and remaining gaps. Never put credentials, tokens, or other secrets here.

Current project status
----------------------
- Project root was organized into include/, src/, examples/, tests/, docs/, and build/.
- The runtime exposes a bounded synchronous mock agent loop: model callback -> one registered tool -> model callback -> final response.
- Tool metadata (name, description, argument schema) is passed to the model callback. The previous tool result is available on the next turn.
- Tool callbacks own JSON argument parsing and validation; the runtime does not provide a generic JSON parser or JSON Schema validator.
- No external LLM/network provider adapter, persistent conversation history, multiple tool calls per response, retries, or enforced timeout/cancellation is implemented.
- The Windows and WSL Ubuntu demo/test scripts have both passed.
- This workspace did not contain a .git directory when checked. .gitignore exists, but Git ignore rules take effect only inside a Git repository.

