Recent work
-----------
[2026-09-29] Organized the project into source, include, example, test, and docs folders; added Makefile, README, and .gitignore. Archived the original combined source and legacy drafts.

[2026-09-30] Added posagent_agent_tool_register() and posagent_context_run_agent(). The bounded loop advertises registered tools, dispatches one requested tool, forwards its result to the next model turn, and returns final text. Added mock integration demo/tests for round-trip, unknown tool, callback-rejected arguments, duplicate registration, turn limit, final buffer overflow, and model timeout propagation. Updated status and usage documentation.

[2026-09-30] Added this root-level shared handoff log, documented the append protocol and verified commands, linked it from README, and added a .gitignore exception so WORKLOG.log is not excluded by *.log.

